  "name": "Stamina Surge",
  "description": "Champion Stamina Surge holds 40 stamina. Hold Secondary to double movement speed, spending 1 stamina per second. While holding Secondary on land, press Jump to leap for 5 stamina. Movement keys select forward, backward, sideways or diagonal leaps; no movement key produces a vertical leap. Release and press Jump for each leap. Reuse requires only enough stamina, not a full refill. Stamina regenerates by 1 per second while not rushing.\n\nProjectile damage remains reduced by 50% during Surge and for 3 seconds afterward.",
